{
 "language": "en",
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 5.0,
   "text": "Hey everybody, you want the secret to Persian delights?"
  },
  {
   "start": 5.42,
   "end": 7.64,
   "text": "Let's make some kubi there tonight!"
  },
  {
   "start": 8.82,
   "end": 10.9,
   "text": "Get your skewers ready!"
  },
  {
   "start": 11.7,
   "end": 13.28,
   "text": "Fire up the grill!"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.44,
   "end": 28.26,
   "text": "Two pounds of lamb, a beef with some fat"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.26,
   "end": 32.58,
   "text": "three grated onions now how about that squeeze out the juice don't let it stay"
  },
  {
   "start": 32.58,
   "end": 37.46,
   "text": "we want that meat to hold its shape add salt and pepper season it right a"
  },
  {
   "start": 37.46,
   "end": 42.14,
   "text": "little turmeric if you like the bite keep it simple keep it real that's how"
  },
  {
   "start": 42.14,
   "end": 47.66,
   "text": "you start a Persian meal mix it mash it work that meat knead it till the texture"
  },
  {
   "start": 47.66,
   "end": 52.18,
   "text": "smooth and neat ten minutes strong let the flavors unite cover and chill it"
  },
  {
   "start": 52.18,
   "end": 53.66,
   "text": "Let it rest overnight"
  },
  {
   "start": 55.66,
   "end": 57.18,
   "text": "Kubi de, Kubi de"
  },
  {
   "start": 57.18,
   "end": 59.28,
   "text": "Persian kebab is on the way"
  },
  {
   "start": 59.86,
   "end": 61.6,
   "text": "On the skewer, on the flame"
  },
  {
   "start": 61.6,
   "end": 63.76,
   "text": "Smokey juicy, that's the game"
  },
  {
   "start": 64.54,
   "end": 65.98,
   "text": "Kubi de, Kubi de"
  },
  {
   "start": 65.98,
   "end": 68.16,
   "text": "Turn it fast, don't let it fall away"
  },
  {
   "start": 68.16,
   "end": 70.48,
   "text": "Rice and butter, sumac too"
  },
  {
   "start": 70.48,
   "end": 75.14,
   "text": "Persian barbecue is waiting for you"
  },
  {
   "start": 76.74,
   "end": 78.84,
   "text": "Watch your hands now grab a ball"
  },
  {
   "start": 79.42,
   "end": 81.04,
   "text": "Presidentally spread it tall"
  },
  {
   "start": 81.04,
   "end": 85.48,
   "text": "Place the meat on a flat metal skewer, shape it evenly, make it smoother"
  },
  {
   "start": 85.48,
   "end": 89.78,
   "text": "Pinch the ridges with your thumb, make those classic grooves become"
  },
  {
   "start": 89.78,
   "end": 94.28,
   "text": "Seal the edges, hold it tight, keep that meat upon the skewer right"
  },
  {
   "start": 94.86,
   "end": 99.32,
   "text": "Gotta get your charcoal glowing red, no big flames beneath the bread"
  },
  {
   "start": 99.32,
   "end": 103.88,
   "text": "Place the skewers side by side, turn them quickly, don't let them slide"
  },
  {
   "start": 103.88,
   "end": 108.26,
   "text": "Flip them off and at the start, that's the secret, that's the art"
  },
  {
   "start": 108.26,
   "end": 112.96,
   "text": "Cook till golden, juicy inside, no raw meat left, when it's time to die"
  },
  {
   "start": 115.4,
   "end": 119.96,
   "text": "Grilled tomatoes, charred and sweet, fresh herbs make the perfect treat"
  },
  {
   "start": 119.96,
   "end": 123.26,
   "text": "Saffron, rice, and golden light, butter melting"
  },
  {
   "start": 123.26,
   "end": 124.36,
   "text": "What a sight!"
  },
  {
   "start": 124.58,
   "end": 128.62,
   "text": "Sprinkle sumac, squeeze some lime, gather round, it's dinner time"
  },
  {
   "start": 128.62,
   "end": 131.22,
   "text": "From Tehran streets to Lanza Forge"
  },
  {
   "start": 131.22,
   "end": 133.36,
   "text": "Persian koubide, the barbecue star"
  },
  {
   "start": 135.72,
   "end": 137.04,
   "text": "Koubide, koubide"
  },
  {
   "start": 137.04,
   "end": 139.3,
   "text": "Made with love, the Persian way"
  },
  {
   "start": 139.3,
   "end": 141.52,
   "text": "Onions, meat and charcoal, heat"
  },
  {
   "start": 141.52,
   "end": 143.64,
   "text": "Nothing beats this smoky treat"
  },
  {
   "start": 143.64,
   "end": 145.96,
   "text": "Oh, Kubidae, Kubidae"
  },
  {
   "start": 145.96,
   "end": 148.34,
   "text": "Bring the family, shout hooray"
  },
  {
   "start": 148.34,
   "end": 150.44,
   "text": "Saffron, rice and kebabs, divine"
  },
  {
   "start": 150.44,
   "end": 153.86,
   "text": "Persian flavor, every time"
  },
  {
   "start": 155.08,
   "end": 157.48,
   "text": "Remember the rule, now here's the key"
  },
  {
   "start": 157.48,
   "end": 160.82,
   "text": "Squeeze those onions, knead carefully"
  },
  {
   "start": 161.56,
   "end": 164.22,
   "text": "Keep turning, till the meat is done"
  },
  {
   "start": 164.22,
   "end": 169.32,
   "text": "Persian Kubida, now that's fun."
  }
 ],
